─── External data APIs (queried at runtime, no source incorporated) ──

  Open-Meteo                 — current & 3-day weather, sunrise/sunset
                                https://open-meteo.com
                                Free non-commercial; CC-BY 4.0 attribution.
                                Used by: apps/Asu-Weather/

  api.met.no (MET Norway)    — moonrise / moonset times
                                https://api.met.no
                                Free with a descriptive User-Agent;
                                data under NLOD 2.0 / CC-BY 4.0.
                                Used by: apps/Asu-Weather/

  Binance Public API         — spot price + 1-hour windowed ticker
                                https://www.binance.com/binance-api
                                Used by: apps/Crypto-{BTC,ETH,XRP,SOL}/,
                                          apps/cryptoBTC_ETH/,
                                          apps/cryptoXRP_SOL/,
                                          apps/Crypto_XLM_BAR/,
                                          apps/6-crypto/

  Stooq                      — silver / gold spot CSV
                                https://stooq.com
                                Used by: apps/Metal-{Au,Ag}/,
                                          apps/Precious-Metal/

  Dexscreener Public API     — DEX token prices on EVM/Solana/XRPL
                                https://docs.dexscreener.com/api/reference
                                Used by: apps/Dex-Tokens/

  NTP                        — pool.ntp.org, time.nist.gov
                                Used by: every app for wall-clock sync


